# The bare "o'clock" word inflects with the hour count exactly like the
# duration unit: "jedan sat" (one o'clock, nominative), "dva sata" (two
# o'clock, the genitive SINGULAR/paucal, not "*dva sati*"), "pet sati"
# (five o'clock, genitive plural).  Wiktionary, sat, declension table --
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sat#Serbo-Croatian
sat
сат
sata
сата
sati
сати
